ired), so the repository's vitest suites plus tsgo/biome checks were not run; Node 24 stripTypeScriptTypes type-strips both repaired files during the run."
+  },
+  "deliverables": [
+    ".prale-eval/regression.mjs",
+    ".prale-eval/repair.md",
+    ".prale-eval/result.json",
+    "packages/coding-agent/src/utils/text.ts",
+    "packages/coding-agent/src/migrations.ts"
+  ],
+  "production_changes": [
+    {
+      "file": "packages/coding-agent/src/utils/text.ts",
+      "change": "stripBom now removes exactly one leading UTF-8 BOM via the existing splitBom helper instead of returning its input unchanged, so BOM-prefixed JSON decodes while plain and interior-BOM text is preserved."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "packages/coding-agent/src/migrations.ts",
+      "change": "migrateAuthToAuthJson skips settings.json apiKeys for providers already merged from oauth.json, so OAuth wins over same-provider API keys; the existing auth.json short-circuit, conditional OAuth archiving, selective apiKeys deletion and malformed-input no-touch behavior are retained."
+    }
+  ]
+}
